text = "Commonly found on forest floors, Lavender Flowers are one of the many edible flora that can be found. While they don’t provide much on their own, they are a great supplement in recipes to add a sweet taste to your dishes. 

The easiest way to tell if you are looking at a Lavender is their incredibly strong floral smell and their lilac-colored petals."
